<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA AND SPAIN LEVEL AT 1-1 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA AND SPAIN LEVEL AT 1-1 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the first day of the Fed Cup World Group play-off tie between Australia and Spain at Hope Island on Saturday.</p>
<p>Singles</p>
<p>Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Rachel McQuillan (Australia) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Annabel Ellwood (Australia) beat Maria Luisa Serna (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
